We don't make children's toys here.

253
00:13:52,340 --> 00:13:55,634
KivaCorp is my company, and
we make vehicles for combat.

254
00:13:55,760 --> 00:13:56,590
Got that?

255
00:13:56,673 --> 00:13:57,503
Now listen to me.

256
00:13:57,586 --> 00:13:59,737
If you're going to take
over this company someday,

257
00:13:59,820 --> 00:14:01,897
you'll have to forget about your games.

258
00:14:01,980 --> 00:14:04,960
I adopted you so you can
learn my family business.

259
00:14:05,220 --> 00:14:08,573
The business of fighting
battles, defeating your enemies,

260
00:14:08,660 --> 00:14:12,360
and rising to ultimate
power. No way! You're insane!

261
00:14:12,720 --> 00:14:15,160
Guards, take my stepson away.

262
00:14:15,400 --> 00:14:16,897
Hey, take your hands off me!

263
00:14:16,980 --> 00:14:18,597
You can't treat me like this!

264
00:14:18,680 --> 00:14:20,780
You'll be sorry, you old fool!

265
00:14:21,580 --> 00:14:23,177
I'll never forget that day.

266
00:14:23,260 --> 00:14:27,360
Not only did my stepfather shoot
down my virtual gaming program,

267
00:14:27,660 --> 00:14:32,189
but to make things worse, he stole my
invention and passed it off as his own!

268
00:14:33,540 --> 00:14:36,460
Seto, we're back in Noah's virtual forest!

269
00:14:36,600 --> 00:14:39,012
I wouldn't call it Noah's forest, Mokuba,

270
00:14:39,180 --> 00:14:42,397
because whoever helped Noah
create this place is using the

271
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:45,940
same virtual technology that
our stepfather stole from me.

272
00:14:46,200 --> 00:14:51,237
Even though it's been enhanced, the basic
program is the same as mine. That's true!

273
00:14:51,320 --> 00:14:53,732
And I have a feeling it's no coincidence.

274
00:14:54,140 --> 00:14:57,037
I just have to remember that
everything we see here is an

275
00:14:57,120 --> 00:15:00,677
illusion because all of these
memories are messing with my head.

276
00:15:00,760 --> 00:15:05,180
Noah, I don't know who you
are, kid, but I'll find out.

277
00:15:05,460 --> 00:15:07,637
I know you can hear everything I say,

278
00:15:07,720 --> 00:15:12,191
and no matter what you're after and
who's helping you, you'll never succeed.

279
00:15:12,520 --> 00:15:13,350
Never.

280
00:15:13,840 --> 00:15:18,540
So if you're so powerful, why don't you
come down here and face me, you coward?

281
00:15:19,400 --> 00:15:21,500
All in good time, Seto.

282
00:15:21,680 --> 00:15:22,900
All in good time.

283
00:15:25,820 --> 00:15:27,480
Call your next witness.

284
00:15:28,040 --> 00:15:29,040
You got it.

285
00:15:29,240 --> 00:15:30,160
Now look out.

286
00:15:30,760 --> 00:15:32,880
Okay, so what's my plan here?

287
00:15:33,060 --> 00:15:36,337
He's got one monster on the
field and one card face down.

288
00:15:36,420 --> 00:15:39,940
So first things first, I
gotta blow away his monster.

289
00:15:40,420 --> 00:15:42,460
I summon Rocket Warrior.

290
00:15:44,840 --> 00:15:47,428
Pretty impressive arsenal
I got here, right?

291
00:15:48,020 --> 00:15:51,240
Hey, Johnson, you got any last requests?

292
00:15:51,560 --> 00:15:57,200
Because I'm about to throw the book and a
big iron claw right at your last monster.

293
00:15:57,600 --> 00:16:01,520
All right, Gear Freed, time to
crush his mystical elf. Now!

294
00:16:03,200 --> 00:16:05,480
Activate Deckmaster Ability. Yeah!

295
00:16:05,760 --> 00:16:07,231
Oh, man, that's not good.

296
00:16:07,320 --> 00:16:10,438
It looks like his Deckmaster
has special powers, too.

297
00:16:11,960 --> 00:16:14,777
Yet another amateur move on his part.

298
00:16:14,860 --> 00:16:18,860
I think it's time to show this kid
what the Judge Man can really do.

299
00:16:20,540 --> 00:16:21,716
Clear the courtroom!

300
00:16:22,020 --> 00:16:23,580
Yeah, clear the courtroom?

301
00:16:23,900 --> 00:16:25,337
What do you mean by that?

302
00:16:25,420 --> 00:16:29,540
I'm giving up 1,000 life points
to activate my special power.

303
00:16:29,940 --> 00:16:34,457
Now you must clear the field of all your
monsters so you're back where you started.

304
00:16:34,540 --> 00:16:35,370
No way!

305
00:16:35,580 --> 00:16:36,620
That's not fair!

306
00:16:36,840 --> 00:16:37,899
Where's my lawyer?

307
00:16:41,820 --> 00:16:43,760
And I'm not through. Next,

308
00:16:43,960 --> 00:16:46,317
you'll lose 500 life
points for each monster

309
00:16:46,400 --> 00:16:48,377
you were forced to remove from the court.

310
00:16:48,460 --> 00:16:49,480
Oh, come on!

311
00:16:49,840 --> 00:16:53,957
I had three monsters,
so that means I lose...

312
00:16:54,040 --> 00:16:55,960
1,500 life points!

313
00:16:56,220 --> 00:16:58,540
That's correct, Joseph. Great!

314
00:16:59,300 --> 00:17:02,680
Okay, minor problem, but
I've got this under control.

315
00:17:03,240 --> 00:17:04,140
Now let's see.

316
00:17:04,520 --> 00:17:05,740
What do we got here?

317
00:17:06,080 --> 00:17:08,537
A bottomless trap hole card!

318
00:17:08,620 --> 00:17:11,517
But this baby will let
me remove any monster

319
00:17:11,600 --> 00:17:14,980
from the field with 1,500
attack points or more. Sweet!

320
00:17:15,260 --> 00:17:18,157
He's not the only one that
can clear the courtroom.

321
00:17:18,240 --> 00:17:21,181
Your days in this courthouse
are numbered, Jansen.

322
00:17:21,340 --> 00:17:23,977
As soon as I send that
mystical elf of yours packing,

323
00:17:24,060 --> 00:17:26,377
I'm going straight for your life points.

324
00:17:26,460 --> 00:17:30,200
And what evidence do you have
to pack that up, may I ask?

325
00:17:30,440 --> 00:17:32,340
I have this card!

326
00:17:34,920 --> 00:17:36,660
Whoa! Check it out!

327
00:17:37,300 --> 00:17:38,320
Yugi, look!

328
00:17:38,480 --> 00:17:40,127
It's some kind of a doorway.

329
00:17:40,540 --> 00:17:42,077
Well, what are we waiting for?

330
00:17:42,160 --> 00:17:42,990
Let's go!

331
00:17:43,660 --> 00:17:45,080
I wonder where it leads.

332
00:17:48,020 --> 00:17:51,220
Who let in the draft?
Can it be? It's Joey!

333
00:17:51,760 --> 00:17:55,420
Hey, Yugi! Taya! Where you been? Order!

334
00:17:55,800 --> 00:17:56,680
Settle down.

335
00:17:56,940 --> 00:17:59,677
This cork is still in session
in case you hadn't noticed.

336
00:17:59,760 --> 00:18:00,701
You're on trial?

337
00:18:01,080 --> 00:18:03,000
I'm dueling one of the big five,

338
00:18:03,120 --> 00:18:06,577
and you're just in time to see me
wipe the courtroom floor with him.

339
00:18:06,660 --> 00:18:09,400
I believe it's my move, so sit down.

340
00:18:09,660 --> 00:18:12,797
You're lucky I don't have you
two ejected from this courtroom.

341
00:18:12,880 --> 00:18:14,097
This doesn't look too good.

342
00:18:14,180 --> 00:18:16,837
Joey has no monsters,
and it's this guy's turn.

343
00:18:16,920 --> 00:18:18,080
Come on, Joey.

344
00:18:18,580 --> 00:18:20,940
I summon Curtain of the Dark Ones.

345
00:18:24,420 --> 00:18:26,980
Then I reveal my face-down card.

346
00:18:29,220 --> 00:18:30,417
Activate Polymerization.

347
00:18:30,500 --> 00:18:34,360
Diffuse together my Mystical Elf
and my Curtain of the Dark Ones.

348
00:18:35,820 --> 00:18:38,297
Whatever monster he's
creating will get sucked

349
00:18:38,380 --> 00:18:42,400
right into my bottomless
trap hole Meet Cameon Wizard

350
00:18:43,600 --> 00:18:44,720
Aw man,

351
00:18:45,060 --> 00:18:49,037
it's only got 1300 attack points
My trap won't work on any monsters

352
00:18:49,120 --> 00:18:53,640
with less than 1500 Next I'll
play the card Sinister Justice

353
00:18:54,420 --> 00:18:59,500
This allows my fusion monster to attack
in the same turn in which it was summoned

354
00:19:00,060 --> 00:19:03,920
Now, Cameon Wizard attack his
life points directly Exactly.

355
00:19:04,580 --> 00:19:05,410
Ah!

356
00:19:05,560 --> 00:19:06,390
Ah!

357
00:19:07,760 --> 00:19:09,280
Oh, no! Joey!

358
00:19:14,860 --> 00:19:16,440
Lucky move, Johnson.

359
00:19:17,640 --> 00:19:19,260
Joey's in big trouble.

360
00:19:20,760 --> 00:19:23,317
As long as Sinister
Justice is on the field,

361
00:19:23,400 --> 00:19:26,577
Johnson gets 800 extra
life points every time he

362
00:19:26,660 --> 00:19:29,601
attacks Joey's life points
with his camion wizard.

363
00:19:29,700 --> 00:19:30,657
How's that again?

364
00:19:30,740 --> 00:19:31,760
Ha ha!

365
00:19:32,060 --> 00:19:34,340
The spiky-headed bipsqueak is right!

366
00:19:34,600 --> 00:19:36,340
His life points are going up!

367
00:19:37,380 --> 00:19:38,620
And there's more!

368
00:19:38,840 --> 00:19:42,180
I placed this card face
down to seal your doom!

369
00:19:42,920 --> 00:19:45,877
If it wasn't for that trap
card, I would've won this duel!

370
00:19:45,960 --> 00:19:49,317
Now, every time he attacks me,
he gets stronger and stronger!

371
00:19:49,400 --> 00:19:52,920
You planned this all along,
didn't you, Johnson? Of course!

372
00:19:53,240 --> 00:19:56,320
But I have far worse in
store for you, Joseph!

373
00:20:10,880 --> 00:20:13,000
Yo, yo, yo, yo.

374
00:20:30,820 --> 00:20:30,934
Thank you.
